# claims.ttl — machine-readable claims–questions–evidence graph for the
# journal, Entries 1–24 (the prose remains authoritative in
# research/notes/MODEL_COMPARISON_JOURNAL.md; Entries 17–22 were the original
# proof of concept, Entries 1–16 and 23–24 were back/forward-filled 2026-07-24).
#
# Stack: widely-used vocabularies ONLY — schema.org (Claim/Question), CiTO
# (typed links: citesAsEvidence, supports/disputes for evidence polarity,
# corrects/updates/qualifies/extends between entries), PROV-O + P-Plan (runs
# and pre-registered protocols), Dublin Core. The former minted phr: vocabulary
# (SEPIO-pattern) was retired 2026-07-24: assertions are schema:Claim,
# evidence lines are minted :assertN_evK nodes that cito:supports/cito:disputes
# their assertion, hypotheses and pre-registrations are marked with
# dcterms:type, verdicts live in dcterms:description.
#
# Validate: python -c "import rdflib; rdflib.Graph().parse('research/notes/claims.ttl')"

@prefix :        <https://danlessa.github.io/bicycling-energy-model/claims#> .
@prefix cito:    <http://purl.org/spar/cito/> .
@prefix prov:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix p-plan:  <http://purl.org/net/p-plan#> .
@prefix schema:  <http://schema.org/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

